<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>404 – Page Not Found | Swapify</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background:#0f0f1a; color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:100vh; }
    .box { text-align:center; padding:40px; }
    h1 { font-size:100px; margin:0; color:#7C3AED; }
    p  { font-size:20px; color:#aaa; margin:16px 0 32px; }
    a  { color:#7C3AED; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; font-size:18px; }
    a:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>The page <strong><%= url %></strong> was not found.</p>
    <a href="/">← Back to Swapify</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
